      "content": "yeah i'll check the underside with a magnifying glass. but i've looked pretty closely like twice now and i just don't see anything. no bugs, no slime trails, nothing. it's like they're just vanishing or appearing out of nowhere. it's getting kind of frustrating, i'm worried about losing the whole batch. could it be something else, like something that only comes out at night?",
